%N A055414 Number of points in Z^8 of norm <= n.
%C A055414 Numbers so far are all 1 mod 16. - _Ralf Stephan_, Jul 07 2003
%H A055414 Andrew J. Morris, <a href="/A055414/b055414.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a> (first 501 terms from Andrew Howroyd)
